{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.dili.2020b.q27.material.recovered", "text": "材料一：“渝新欧”铁路是重庆至欧洲的国际铁路大通道，于2011年1月开通。这条铁路从重庆出发，至德国的杜伊斯堡，全长11179千米，是世界上最长的铁路之一。内陆货物经该线出口欧洲实行“一次申报、一次查验、一次放行”。材料二：下面的图为“渝新欧”铁路线运行示意图及重庆和杜伊斯堡气温曲线和降水量柱状图。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b66c28679368dfd665506f854bab8f9e9ec4e9cf46675f58b290999e2f9ab492", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1698, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1848, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b66c28679368dfd665506f854bab8f9e9ec4e9cf46675f58b290999e2f9ab492"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2020b.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k04", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k07", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k11"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.311.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2020b.q27"], "word_count": 150, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "dili", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b66c28679368dfd665506f854bab8f9e9ec4e9cf46675f58b290999e2f9ab492", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1698, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1848, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b66c28679368dfd665506f854bab8f9e9ec4e9cf46675f58b290999e2f9ab492"}], "type": "真题", "copyright"