{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.dili.2020b.q28.material.recovered", "text": "下面是某老师的“独占一块大陆的国家”教学片段。师：（展示课件）我们来看一下澳大利亚的位置和范围，大家会选择定居在哪里呢？生：我选择在东南沿海，因为沿海地区降水多。生：我选择在沙漠，因为矿产资源丰富。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b66c28679368dfd665506f854bab8f9e9ec4e9cf46675f58b290999e2f9ab492", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1944, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2043, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b66c28679368dfd665506f854bab8f9e9ec4e9cf46675f58b290999e2f9ab492"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2020b.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k11", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s2.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.311.r001", "ntce.outline.311.r005", "ntce.outline.311.r006", "ntce.outline.311.r014", "ntce.outline.311.r017", "ntce.outline.311.r018", "ntce.outline.311.r019"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2020b.q28"], "word_count": 99, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "dili", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b66c28679368dfd665506f854bab8f9e9ec4e9cf46675f58b290999e2f9ab492", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1944, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2043, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locat